  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enabling alternative sustainable uses of crop residue burning in the state of Punjab</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support the development of integrated strategies for crop residue management that is grounded in robust evidence. More specifically, the output of the project activities will provide essential groundwork that will unlock the possibility for the State of Punjab to develop an effective value chain for crop residues.</narrative>
  </description>
